# Feature modules live here.
#
# Each feature is self-contained and follows this structure:
#
#   features/<feature>/
#     components/    UI specific to the feature
#     hooks/         React Query hooks (useClients, useCreateClient, ...)
#     services/      Data access built on @/lib/supabase
#     schemas/       Zod schemas + inferred types
#     types.ts       Feature-local types
#     index.ts       Public surface of the feature
#
# Keep cross-feature reusable pieces in src/components/shared, src/hooks,
# src/lib and src/utils instead.
